flowchart TD
    A[Client sends multipart image] --> B[ASP.NET Core binds IFormFile]
    B --> C{File empty?}

    C -- Yes --> C1[400 empty_file]
    C -- No --> D{File exceeds size limit?}

    D -- Yes --> D1[400 file_too_large]
    D -- No --> E{Extension allowed?}

    E -- No --> E1[400 unsupported_file_extension]
    E -- Yes --> F{Content type allowed?}

    F -- No --> F1[400 unsupported_content_type]
    F -- Yes --> G[Map extension and content type to formats]

    G --> H{Metadata formats agree?}
    H -- No --> H1[400 file_metadata_mismatch]
    H -- Yes --> I[Open uploaded file stream]

    I --> J[Read up to 12 header bytes]
    J --> K{Signature recognized?}

    K -- No --> K1[400 unrecognized_file_signature]
    K -- Yes --> L{Detected format matches metadata?}

    L -- No --> L1[400 file_signature_mismatch]
    L -- Yes --> M[Return metadata and detected format]

    M --> N[200 OK]